G["Death to Vol'jin and all of his allies!"]="¡Muerte a Vol'jin y a todos sus aliados!"
G["Death to all invaders!"]="¡Muerte a todos los invasores!"
G["Death to all that oppose us!"]="¡Muerte a todos nuestros oponentes!"
