G["Did you truly believe that the orcs had the presence of mind required to plan an invasion of this magnitude?"]="¿En serio crees que los orcos tienen el cerebro necesario para planear una invasión de esta magnitud?"
G["Did you truly expect to fulfill Mograine's task unopposed?"]="¿Esperabais completar la tarea de Mograine sin resistencia?"
G["Did you... Did you meet her?"]="¿La... la viste?"
G["Did... did he just say I was like a son to him?"]="¿Acaba... acaba de decir que yo era como un hijo para él?"
G["Did... did that just happen?"]="¿Acaba de ocurrir eso?"
G["Did... did you see that?"]="¿Has... Has visto eso?"
G["Didn't I tell you my new domination techniques would work?"]="¿No te dije que mis nuevas técnicas de dominación funcionarían?"
G["Didn't drag anything in with ya, did ya?"]="¿No has arrastrado nada dentro contigo, verdad?"
