G["Numerous? It has two weak points: The base of the structure on the west side and the base of the structure on the east side. Hey, wait a minute. How would you know anything about the Vector Coil? Didn't you say that you were captured before you even materialized?"]="¿Numerosos? Tiene dos puntos débiles: la base de la estructura del lado oeste y la base de la estructura del lado este. Eh, espera un momento. ¿Cómo ibas a saber nada de la Espiral Vectorial? ¿No has dicho que te capturaron antes de materializarte siquiera?"
G["Nurse Lillian sighs."]="La enfermera Lillian suspira."
G["Nurse Mildred is real nice, she took care of my dad when he was hurt."]="La enfermera Mildred es muy simpática. Cuidó de mi papá cuando estaba herido."
G["Nurse Neela greets all of her future customers as they enter the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town."]="La enfermera Neela da la bienvenida a todos sus futuros clientes cuando entran en el Mesón La Horca, en el extremo sureste de la ciudad."
G["Nurse."]="Enfermera."
G["Nuthin' good!\n\nI'm on to that one. He lures fools in with promises of wealth, keeps 'em drunk, an' then uses 'em to do his dirty work - which ends up gettin' em killed often as not."]="¡Nada bueno!\n\nLe estoy siguiendo la pista. Engaña a los insensatos con promesas de riqueza, los emborracha y los usa para hacer el trabajo sucio, que a menudo acaba matándolos."
G["Nutmegs don't fail me now!"]="¡Nuez moscada, no me falles ahora!"
