G["Ponder on da thing you have witnessed this day, $n.\n\nDa future already be written. Only thing to decide be your part in it, mon."]="Medita sobre lo que has visto hoy, $n.\n\nEl futuro ya está escrito. Solo te queda decidir qué papel vas a jugar en él, tron."
G["Poo not good to eat, but very good to throw."]="Kaka no se kome, kaka se lanza."
