G["Possessed by what?"]="¿Poseída por qué?"
G["Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy.  Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag."]="Pociones y aceites, son cosas sobre las que Yelmak te enseñará si eres $gdigno:digna; de ello. Busca su tienda en medio de la Calle Mayor."
G["Pounce!"]="¡Abalanzarse!"
