G["Start Basic Damage (Endless)"]="Iniciar DPS básico (Interminable)"
G["Start Basic Damage (Gold)"]="Iniciar DPS básico (Oro)"
G["Start Basic Damage (Silver)"]="Iniciar DPS básico (Plata)"
