G["Start Basic Healer (Endless)"]="Iniciar sanador básico (Interminable)"
G["Start Basic Healer (Gold)"]="Iniciar sanador básico (Oro)"
G["Start Basic Healer (Silver)"]="Iniciar sanador básico (Plata)"
