G["Take me to this Earthen Ring friend of yours. I have important news for the two of you."]="Llévame ante esa amiga tuya del Anillo de la Tierra. Tengo noticias importantes para ambos."
G["Take me with you, $g sir:ma'am;."]="Llévame contigo, $gseñor:señora;."
