G["Tell Lexlort if he wants the information, all he has to do is pay! Unfortunately, that means he can't kill me if he wants the information - since I burned the battle plans and all..."]="¡Dile a Lexlort que si quiere la información solo tiene que pagar! Eso significa que no puede matarme porque quemé los planos de batalla y todo..."
